---
import Flow from '../Flow.astro';
---
<figure class="figure">
  <div class="diagram">
    <Flow
      stages={[
        { title: 'Clinical workflows', items: ['React', '13 workflows', 'imaging, voice-to-SOAP, lab extraction'] },
        { title: 'Application backend', items: ['Node.js', 'RBAC access control', 'notifications', 'PostgreSQL, Redis'] },
        { title: 'AI orchestration layer', items: ['one interface for every model call', 'routes to a provider'] },
        { title: 'Model providers', items: ['Groq (hosted)', 'MedGemma via Ollama (local)'] },
      ]}
    />
  </div>
  <figcaption class="note">Simplified architecture. Features ask the orchestration layer for a capability instead of calling a model API directly.</figcaption>
</figure>
